♪ Where all the money has gone

795
01:14:00.560 --> 01:14:09.366
♪ I've got a whole lot of work
To do with your heart

796
01:14:09.520 --> 01:14:13.889
♪ 'Cause it's so easy

797
01:14:14.000 --> 01:14:16.287
♪ Mine's not

798
01:14:19.560 --> 01:14:26.284
♪ Loving strangers

799
